Salt & Straw are known for some "out there" flavours but is this one really that crazy? 

Maple Bacon is a well known and documented flavour combo that was made "famous" by Voodoo Donuts (which are great by the way). 

If you fancy giving this one a go, there's a few bits you'll need to go through. With that in mind, let's get in to it.

The Streusel:
80 g quick-cook oats
40g sifted all-purpose flour
80 g dark brown sugar
0.5 teaspoons salt
75 g cold butter

The Candied Bacon:
50g maple Syrup
50g Brown sugar
Bacon

The Ice Cream:
60g Sugar
30g SMP
1g Xanthan gum or stabiliser
30g light corn syrup or golden syrup
315ml Milk @ 1.8%
315ml Heavy cream @ 35% fat
100g Maple Syrup @ 65% sugar

With all these ingredients ready, it's pretty easy to make. Although for me, this didn't "float my boat" i get why people do like it. 

